flowchart TD
    A[Client caches tool list] --> B[Application opens a project]
    B --> N[Tool list change notice]
    N --> L[Client fetches fresh schemas]
    L --> C[Call with project revision]
    C --> R{Revision still current?}
    R -->|Yes| V[Validate arguments and execute]
    R -->|No| E[Return stale revision error]
    E --> L
    B --> M[Another project edit]
    M --> R
